  "step_3": "The decision reason requires considering outcomes with less than 20% probability and adjusting their weight by +10 percentage points. In this problem, no outcome has a probability below 20%, so the reason is inapplicable. The individual’s justification is based solely on expected value and perceived high probability (80%), not on any adjustment of low-probability outcomes. Since the condition for the reason is not met and no such adjustment is mentioned, the individual did not use the decision reason. Therefore, the reason was not used in the decision-making process.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
